	(text "J21 = west header (the N6's right header J3), J22 = east header (the N6's left header J2). Small text = the N6's pin name.\nFootprints on the N6-facing side (flipped), pad 1 at the camera end, odd pads on the east column of each header:\nas header() in scripts/n6_rough_board.py (mock P). Pin numbers: scripts/stage0/n6_pinmap.py."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
